cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its measurements, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Titan: cycle-level measurement of market-data handling and inter-core hand-off on Apple M4"
abstract: >-
  Measurement apparatus, pre-registered protocol and full result set for a
  cycle-level study of memory-ordering cost in a single-producer
  single-consumer ring on a fanless Apple M4. Includes the measurement
  harness, a user-space interface to the Apple performance monitoring unit,
  every raw run, a register of 94 pre-registered hypothesis rows with their
  verdicts, a register of 44 logged defects in the authors' own method, and
  eleven automated checks that refuse a manuscript whose numbers, thresholds
  or figures do not match the files they are drawn from. The checks are
  documented separately so they can be adopted without this project.
